        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes kuungá' a /ayiindá', laqaá bar wahaandá', laqaá umuúqo gaaro ar ta tlehha'a, sleémeero tlehhiitaak as xirfuú Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' ma dukuutsmo tleehhitaara' dír múk Yahudiro, laqaá dír múk Yunaniro, laqaá tam dír múk kríshaanayhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ar adoodá' aníng ni tlehhaahhiit. Asma aníng umuúqo heewo un sla'atisár wa slaá' baraá muruudá' sleémeerowo ni tlehhiita. Gadaádá' aníng i gaa wa buu' a leelehhiitaaká, ala a tidá' múk yaariír gu gaa wa buu' an leelehhiít, as kahhó' inooín kiwa ba/amisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.33",
